WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.820
This is what our perfect one-day trip around Serbia looked like.

2
00:00:04.160 --> 00:00:06.280
Hi, we're Petra and Martina,

3
00:00:06.280 --> 00:00:08.340
this is how in one day we toured

4
00:00:08.340 --> 00:00:12.680
four completely different, equally wonderful places in our country.

5
00:00:12.900 --> 00:00:15.620
First we visited the Manasija monastery,

6
00:00:15.620 --> 00:00:17.400
one of the most significant monuments

7
00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:19.220
of Serbian medieval culture.

8
00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:21.940
Then we went deep underground,

9
00:00:21.940 --> 00:00:24.280
into the magical world of the Resava Cave.

10
00:00:24.280 --> 00:00:26.360
We took a lunch break

11
00:00:26.360 --> 00:00:28.900
with a view of the spectacular Veliki Buk waterfall,

12
00:00:28.900 --> 00:00:32.000
and for dessert — the Krupajsko Vrelo spring.

13
00:00:32.340 --> 00:00:35.080
We booked this trip through the GetYourGuide app,

14
00:00:35.080 --> 00:00:37.220
and you save this video for inspiration

15
00:00:37.220 --> 00:00:40.120
and send it to the person who's supposed to take you there.